<title>CHINA: Trading in CNT Group shares suspended.</title>
<headline>Trading in CNT Group shares suspended.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in shares of CNT Group Ltd was suspended on Tuesday at the request of the company pending an announcement, the Stock Exchange of Hong Kong said.</p>
<p>The paint manufacturer's shares closed at HK$1.44 on Monday.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6345</p>
</text>
